# Plan: Infinite Canvas Learning Interface

## Goal
Transform the learning session into an "Infinite Drawing Canvas" (Miro/Excalidraw style). The Canvas will be the primary full-screen interface, allowing users to explore lesson content Spatially. The AI Voice Agent will be minimized to a floating "Co-pilot" widget.

## Proposed Changes

### Frontend Components

#### [MODIFY] [WhiteboardCanvas.tsx](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/components/learning-session/WhiteboardCanvas.tsx)
*   **Enable Infinite Pan**: Set `draggable` on the main Konva `Stage`.
*   **Enable Zoom**: Implement wheel event monitoring to update `scale` and `position` relative to mouse pointer.
*   **Visual Styles**: Add a dot/grid pattern background that scales with the view to enhance the "infinite" feel.
*   **Tools**: Add a simple floating toolbar (Pan, Select, Pencil (placeholder)).

#### [MODIFY] [VoiceAgentVisual.tsx](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/components/learning-session/VoiceAgentVisual.tsx)
*   **Minimize**: Redesign as a compact floating widget (glassmorphism style) rather than a full sidebar.
*   **States**: "Listening" vs "Idle" states expressed via subtle glowing borders/icons instead of a giant pulsing orb.

#### [MODIFY] [page.tsx](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/app/learn/[lessonId]/page.tsx)
*   **Layout**: Remove the grid/split-pane. Make [WhiteboardCanvas](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/components/learning-session/WhiteboardCanvas.tsx#6-48) full screen.
*   **Overlay**: Place [VoiceAgentVisual](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/components/learning-session/VoiceAgentVisual.tsx#7-76) as an absolute positioned element on top of the canvas (e.g., bottom-right or top-right).

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
1.  **Pan/Zoom**: Open a lesson, use mouse drag to pan and scroll wheel to zoom.
2.  **Responsiveness**: Resize window and ensure canvas adapts.
3.  **Visual Check**: Confirm the "bot" is no longer the center of attention.
